<LanguageData>
  <!--原中文: '奥术电池', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Arcane Capacitor',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Arcane Capacitor-->
  <TM_ArcaneCapacitor.label>奥术电池</TM_ArcaneCapacitor.label>
  <!--原中文: '奥术电池能够储存多余的法力供法师在需要的时候吸取。执行魔法工作且法力值在90%以上的法师会自动给电池充能，直到电池达到设定的电量。法力值低于25%的法师无法为电池充能。\n  电池会自动为范围内被征召且法力值低于90%的法师补充法力。在法力释放的过程中会损耗一些法力值。\n  \n效率: 71%', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'The Arcane Capacitor is able to store mana as a form of potential energy that mages can draw upon at a later time. Mages assigned to magic tasks will charge the battery until it reaches its set fill level. A mage will only perform this task if their mana level is above 90% of their maximum.

The arcane capacitor will discharge mana to any undrafted pawn in range if the mana ratio of the capacitor is greater than 250% of the mage. Drafted mages will forcibly draw mana from the capacitor until the capacitor is empty or the mage has 90% or more mana.

Some mana is lost during the discharging process.
Efficiency: 71%',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: The Arcane Capacitor is able to store mana as a form of potential energy that mages can draw upon at a later time. Mages assigned to magic tasks will charge the battery until it reaches its set fill level. A mage will only perform this task if their mana level is above 90% of their maximum.

The arcane capacitor will discharge mana to any undrafted pawn in range if the mana ratio of the capacitor is greater than 250% of the mage. Drafted mages will forcibly draw mana from the capacitor until the capacitor is empty or the mage has 90% or more mana.

Some mana is lost during the discharging process.
Efficiency: 71%-->
  <TM_ArcaneCapacitor.description>奥术电池能够储存多余的法力供法师在需要的时候吸取。执行魔法工作且法力值在90%以上的法师会自动给电池充能，直到电池达到设定的电量。法力值低于25%的法师无法为电池充能。\n  电池会自动为范围内被征召且法力值低于90%的法师补充法力。在法力释放的过程中会损耗一些法力值。\n  \n效率: 71%</TM_ArcaneCapacitor.description>
  <!--原中文: '维度法球', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Dimensional Mana Pocket',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Dimensional Mana Pocket-->
  <TM_DimensionalManaPocket.label>维度法球</TM_DimensionalManaPocket.label>
  <!--原中文: '维度法球可以储存比电池更多的法力且拥有更大的释放范围。执行魔法工作且法力值在90%以上的法师会自动给法球充能，直到法球达到设定的电量。法力值低于40%的法师无法为法球充能。\n  法球会自动为范围内被征召且法力值低于80%的法师补充法力。在法力释放的过程中会损耗一些法力值。\n\n效率: 80%', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'The dimensional mana pocket stores a tremendous amount of mana and has a large distribution coverage area but is slower than the arcane capacitor to redistribute mana when it's needed
	
Mages assigned to magic tasks will store mana in the dimensional pocket until it reaches its set fill level. A mage will only perform this task if their mana level is above 90% of their maximum.

The dimensional pocket will discharge mana to any undrafted pawn in range if their mana is below 40% and to any drafted mage with mana lower than 80%.

Some mana is lost during both the charging and discharging process.
Efficiency: 80%',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: The dimensional mana pocket stores a tremendous amount of mana and has a large distribution coverage area but is slower than the arcane capacitor to redistribute mana when it's needed
	
Mages assigned to magic tasks will store mana in the dimensional pocket until it reaches its set fill level. A mage will only perform this task if their mana level is above 90% of their maximum.

The dimensional pocket will discharge mana to any undrafted pawn in range if their mana is below 40% and to any drafted mage with mana lower than 80%.

Some mana is lost during both the charging and discharging process.
Efficiency: 80%-->
  <TM_DimensionalManaPocket.description>维度法球可以储存比电池更多的法力且拥有更大的释放范围。执行魔法工作且法力值在90%以上的法师会自动给法球充能，直到法球达到设定的电量。法力值低于40%的法师无法为法球充能。\n  法球会自动为范围内被征召且法力值低于80%的法师补充法力。在法力释放的过程中会损耗一些法力值。\n\n效率: 80%</TM_DimensionalManaPocket.description>
</LanguageData>
